    "description": "<p>The Sidereal smooths the passage of a living being through states of change—recovery, illness, or the transition between life and death. This Charm assists natural healing or disease recovery. The character may use this Charm on a patient to ease them through a difficult medical transition, reducing the difficulty of any Medicine roll made to treat the patient by the Sidereal's Essence. Additionally, a dying patient stabilized while under this Charm's influence loses an additional die penalty to attempts to cling to life.</p>",
